| **C** | • Makes correct decisions quickly  <br>• 100 % reliable  <br>• Creates a positive atmosphere with crew | • Difficulty communicating ideas  <br>• Regarded as egocentric  <br>• Not very willing to further his education |
| **D** | • Responds adequately to unexpected events  <br>• Excellent concentration  <br>• Solves problems extremely well  <br>• Takes responsibility seriously | • Regarded as arrogant  <br>• Relatively weak leadership skills  <br>• Arrogant (already)  <br>• Know‑it‑all perception, hot temper (agent 2)  <br>• Moody and loner traits (agent 3) |

