| **C** | Makes correct decisions quickly; keeps calm in a crisis; understands complicated technology; crew‑care attitude; **100 % reliable** (agent 1); **creates positive crew atmosphere** (agent 1). | Difficulty communicating ideas; regarded as egocentric; not very willing to further education. |
| **D** | Responds adequately to unexpected events; concentrates very well; solves problems extremely well; takes responsibility seriously. | Regarded as a know‑it‑all; hot temper; moodiness/loner traits (agent 3). |

### My Position (Agent 2)  
- **My Last Vote:** Candidate D  
- **Current Working Favorite:** Candidate D  
- **Confidence / Uncertainty:** Moderate – D offers the most balanced mix of technical competence, reliability, and responsibility, but his “know‑it‑all” perception and hot temper remain concerns.

### Other Agents’ Positions & Contributions  

| Agent | Latest Vote | Key Evidence Reported |
